<p><strong>After:</strong></p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a bulleted list detailing the accomplishmen=
ts of a Software Engineer at Gibbery, specifically within the Billing team.=
  The list comprises five bullet points, each describing a distinct project=
